Flight Paths S1, E1: Atticus Sappington — from a Walk on to Starting Kicker & Finding Faith

Episode 1 features Atticus Sappington, Oregon Football’s starting kicker. Today we discussed his process from being a high school soccer athlete to inevitably becoming the starting kicker at @oregonfootball.

Sappington talks about how his faith journey truly began with Oregon State Football and how it has shaped him as an athlete and individual.

